" target="law:Ger">Ger</ref> 13; on þam <hi rend="italic">woran</hi> 8 <hi rend="bold">4</hi>) <hi rend="italic">liefern, besorgen, verschaffen:</hi> him mete <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAtr">II Atr</ref> 1,1 | <hi rend="italic">erbringen</hi> að <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IEw">I Ew</ref> 1,2; <hi rend="italic">bestellen: einen Gerefa</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 25; <hi rend="italic">einen Geleitsmann</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAs">VI</ref> 4; him hlaford <hi rend="italic">ihm einen Herrn</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II</ref> 2; him festermen <hi rend="italic">sich Bürgen</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northu">Northu</ref> 2,3; borh <hi rend="italic">Bürgschaft:</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 25. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Grith">Grið</ref> 17 (þæs <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:dafur"><abbr>dafür</abbr></ref></hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:EGu">EGu</ref> 3); him <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:fur"><abbr>für</abbr></ref> sich</hi> <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III Eg</ref> 7. <ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 27 = <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 5,3 = <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II</ref> 36,1; þærto werborh <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> 7,2 = <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wer">Wer</ref> 3 <hi rend="bold">5</hi>) <hi rend="italic"><ref type="abbreviation" target="gram:fur"><abbr>für</abbr></ref> sich sorgen, bewirken, dass:</hi> ~ him, þæt he borh hæbbe <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIIEg">III Eg</ref> 6 <hi rend="bold">6</hi>) <hi rend="italic">be(er)finden, erachten:</hi> wace bið hyrde funden <ref type="lawCode" target="law:ICn">I Cn</ref> 26,1 | <hi rend="italic">festsetzen, bestimmen:</hi> hit bið þus funden <ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 20,1; heregeata <ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 71; <hi r